# Beyond assets/source/.gitignore: what the scripts here make again.
# The image model's run logs; its briefs, reports and last messages are kept.
artist-transcript*.txt
# Fields the material scripts write into source/ from their own construction (wood keeps generated_wood.png, the one
# picture the image model made for the materials).
tex/wood/source/cleaned_source.png
tex/wood/source/quilted_pigment.png
tex/lashing/source/*.png
tex/stone/source/*.png
# The binding and the stone are used at 1,024 (asset.ts); their 2,048 sets are rebuilt byte for byte by
# build_material.py, and the flint's roughness as made is kept beside the tuned map only on disk (tune_flint.py).
tex/lashing/lashing_*[a-z].png
tex/stone/stone_*[a-z].png
tex/stone/flint_*[a-z].png
tex/stone/flint_orm_made*.png
# Blender's backup copies of the concept's masters.
*.blend1
